[unordered] SMEMBERS a2
# Integers: Redis keeps these as a sorted intset and kesh does not; the members agree, not the order.
SADD ints 5 3 1 -2 1000000000000
[unordered] SMEMBERS ints
SISMEMBER ints 3
SISMEMBER ints 03
SADD ints 03
SCARD ints
# Where Redis's listpack ends (128 members, 64 bytes); kesh packs to the same limits.
